  "historyNote": "#9998, eff 9-20-11 (from Puc 902.08); ss by #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.10) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.12); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.09)",
